---
// src/components/CompostQueNace.astro
---

<section
  id="compost-que-nace"
  class="py-24 bg-gris-claro relative overflow-hidden"
>
  <!-- Decorative background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div
      class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-gris-claro rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-50"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute top-1/2 -left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-verde/10 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-40"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 pt-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Content column -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-gris-claro text-verde-oscuro text-sm titulo-secundario tracking-wide mb-6"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-4 h-4"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            stroke-width="2"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          Nueva Vida Perfilada
        </div>

        <h2
          class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-title text-verde-oscuro tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6"
        >
          El Compost que<br />
          <span
            class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-verde-oscuro to-green-500"
            >Nace de tu Esfuerzo</span
          >
        </h2>

        <p class="text-lg text-verde-oscuro leading-relaxed mb-8 font-sans">
          A través de nuestro riguroso proceso de compostaje industrial,
          transformamos toneladas de residuos en compost de alta calidad. Lo que
          alguna vez fue un desecho, florece como un sustrato vital.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div
            class="flex items-start bg-gris-claro p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-verde-oscuro/20 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div
              class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gris-claro flex items-center justify-center text-verde"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke-width="1.5"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M14 10h4.764a2 2 0 011.789 2.894l-3.5 7A2 2 0 0115.263 21h-4.017c-.163 0-.326-.02-.485-.06L7 20m7-10V5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-.095c-.5 0-.905.405-.905.905 0 .714-.211 1.412-.608 2.006L7 11v9m7-10h-2M7 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2h2.5"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg titulo-secundario text-verde-oscuro">
                Rico en Nutrientes Naturales
              </h4>
              <p
                class="mt-1 text-sm text-verde-oscuro/70 leading-relaxed font-sans"
              >
                Aporta macro y micronutrientes esenciales como Nitrógeno,
                Fósforo y Potasio, directamente asimilables por las plantas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex items-start bg-gris-claro p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-verde-oscuro/20 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div
              class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gris-claro flex items-center justify-center text-verde"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke-width="1.5"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M12 2.25c-5.385 4.757-8.25 8.92-8.25 12.352 0 4.67 3.693 8.398 8.25 8.398s8.25-3.728 8.25-8.398c0-3.432-2.865-7.595-8.25-12.352z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg titulo-secundario text-verde-oscuro">
                Alta Retención de Humedad
              </h4>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Mejora la estructura del suelo actuando como una esponja
                natural, reduciendo significativamente la necesidad de riego.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex items-start bg-gris-claro p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-verde-oscuro/20 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <div
              class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gris-claro flex items-center justify-center text-verde"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke-width="1.5"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg titulo-secundario text-verde-oscuro">
                Actividad Microbiana
              </h4>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Reintroduce microorganismos benéficos al suelo, fortaleciendo la
                inmunidad del ecosistema frente a plagas y enfermedades.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual column -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 relative flex justify-center text-center">
        <!-- Abstract representation of compost / earth / leaf -->
        <div class="relative w-72 h-72 md:w-96 md:h-96">
          <!-- Background blobs -->
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-verde/30 to-verde rounded-full animate-pulse blur-xl opacity-30"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-verde-oscuro to-green-700 rounded-[40%] transform rotate-12 shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-700 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-105 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center border-8 border-white/20"
          >
            <!-- Inner leaf icon -->
            <svg
              class="w-1/2 h-1/2 text-gris-claro/90 drop-shadow-md"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                d="M17,8C8,10 5.9,16.17 3.82,21.34L5.71,22L6.66,19.7C7.14,19.87 7.64,20 8,20C19,20 22,3 22,3C21,5 14,5.25 9,6.25C4,7.25 2,11.5 2,13.5C2,15.5 3.75,17.25 3.75,17.25C7,8 17,8 17,8Z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            <!-- Overlay gradients -->
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-gris-claro opacity-10 rounded-[40%] inline-block transform -translate-y-1/2 rotate-45"
            >
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating badge 1 -->
          <div
            class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 md:-top-10 md:right-0 bg-gris-claro p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-verde-oscuro/20 animate-bounce"
            style="animation-duration: 3s;"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span
                class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-verde/20 text-verde titulo-secundario"
                >100%</span
              >
              <p
                class="text-xs titulo-secundario text-verde-oscuro leading-tight"
              >
                Orgánico y<br />Natural
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating badge 2 -->
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-4 md:-bottom-10 md:left-4 bg-gris-claro p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-verde-oscuro/20 animate-bounce"
            style="animation-duration: 4s; animation-delay: 1s;"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div
                class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gris-claro flex items-center justify-center text-verde"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-5 h-5"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  ><path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg
                >
              </div>
              <p
                class="text-xs titulo-secundario text-verde-oscuro leading-tight"
              >
                Alto<br />Rendimiento
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
